<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-002" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi-ws2567463">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001:m0000" ref="52e_1dd_651">張玄之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001:m0004" ref="52e_1dd_651">祖希</persName>，呉郡太守<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001:m0011" ref="lw5_xch_ydg">澄</persName>之孫也。少以學顯，厯吏部尚書，出爲冠軍將軍、呉興太守。會稽内史<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001:m0043" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CD">謝玄</persName>同時之郡，論者以爲南北之望。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001:m0059" ref="52e_1dd_651">玄之</persName>名亞<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-zhangzuxi:p001:m0063" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CD">謝玄</persName>，時亦稱『南北二玄』，卒於郡。</p>
</text>
